WEBVTT

1
00:07:32.911 --> 00:07:33.954
Go. go. go!

2
00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.349
I didn't get him.

3
00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.934
There were two others there.

4
00:09:19.935 --> 00:09:21.352
They were expecting us.

5
00:09:21.353 --> 00:09:22.436
<i>It doesn't matter.</i>

6
00:09:22.437 --> 00:09:25.106
<i>They'll have to report that
he's under threat now. That's all we need.</i>

7
00:09:25.107 --> 00:09:27.191
What if he gives them
the girlfriend's address?

8
00:09:27.192 --> 00:09:28.694
<i>Then they'll get a surprise.</i>

9
00:09:31.321 --> 00:09:32.573
Meet you at the rendezvous.

10
00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.585
Go. go. Come on.

11
00:12:37.257 --> 00:12:38.424
I'm sorry.

12
00:12:38.425 --> 00:12:39.509
I failed.

13
00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:43.722
I told you.
all we need is for MI5 to look into him.

14
00:12:44.598 --> 00:12:45.766
And you played your part.

15
00:12:47.392 --> 00:12:48.977
So what now?

16
00:12:50.354 --> 00:12:52.772
After Abbotsfield. we hit them again.

17
00:12:52.773 --> 00:12:54.107
Bigger than the first time.

18
00:12:55.192 --> 00:12:57.653
We need them to be confused and scared.

19
00:12:59.154 --> 00:13:00.614
I need a hospital.

20
00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.365
Rest.

21
00:13:02.366 --> 00:13:03.909
We'll take care of you.

22
00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.311
Where are we?

23
00:21:52.688 --> 00:21:55.232
Didn't you say
you'd take me to the hospital?

24
00:21:56.149 --> 00:21:57.483
Calm down.

25
00:21:57.484 --> 00:21:59.111
I'm blind in one eye

26
00:21:59.862 --> 00:22:01.655
and the bitch stabbed me with a needle.

27
00:22:02.447 --> 00:22:04.032
And it's still in my thigh.

28
00:22:04.366 --> 00:22:05.784
Control yourself.

29
00:22:06.326 --> 00:22:07.536
This is a battlefield.

30
00:22:07.911 --> 00:22:09.453
We've been here before.

31
00:22:09.454 --> 00:22:10.663
We have to help him.

32
00:22:10.664 --> 00:22:13.542
Give him something for the pain until
we can get him seen to.

33
00:22:19.131 --> 00:22:21.717
You'll draw attention
if you go to the hospital.

34
00:22:22.509 --> 00:22:24.970
MI5 know your injuries.
They will be looking for you.

35
00:22:27.264 --> 00:22:29.140
- Where are you going?
- No. no. no.

36
00:22:29.141 --> 00:22:30.934
- No. no. no.
- Are you crazy?

37
00:22:57.711 --> 00:22:59.713
What the fuck? You killed him.

38
00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:02.007
He was your friend. And you killed him.

39
00:23:04.718 --> 00:23:07.137
He was a soldier. he knew the risks.

40
00:23:08.180 --> 00:23:12.184
If you want to be a soldier.
you need to learn and understand that too.

41
00:26:21.248 --> 00:26:23.541
Mum! Put the knife down.

42
00:26:23.542 --> 00:26:26.128
Mum. give me... give me the knife.
give me the knife!

43
00:26:27.462 --> 00:26:28.463
I'll talk to them.

44
00:26:29.464 --> 00:26:30.841
Go to sleep.

45
00:27:15.594 --> 00:27:18.305
Mum! Go to sleep! Bloody hell!

46
00:36:12.422 --> 00:36:13.841
Ready to play your part?

47
00:36:15.592 --> 00:36:16.717
What do we do about him?

48
00:36:16.718 --> 00:36:18.220
We can't drive around
with a dead body in the back.

49
00:36:26.478 --> 00:36:28.105
And we can't just leave him here.
He'll be identified.

50
00:36:29.064 --> 00:36:30.232
No. he won't.
